sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as 实现节点
    participant Q as QA 节点
    participant B as 驱动器(Bridge)
    B->>I: 派发(无 QA fix context)
    I->>I: 覆盖写两行:drill / AWAITING-QA(清掉上一轮的 FIXED-FOR-CLAIM 1)
    I->>B: 交付 #1(摘要带 run=047a5977 HANDIN1=SHA)
    B->>Q: QA 第 1 轮(无 QA re-verification context)
    Q->>B: fixed-for-claim = fail(计划内失败,产生 claim id)
    B->>I: 返工派发:QA verdict to fix: claim <id>
    I->>I: PREV = 本轮 HANDIN1,第 2 行改为 FIXED-FOR-CLAIM <id>
    I->>B: 交付 #2(HANDIN2)
    B->>Q: 重验(Previous QA verdict: claim <id>)
    Q->>B: fixed-for-claim = pass(逐字匹配)
